<title>GREECE: CYPRUS STOCK EXCHANGE BRIEFS GREEK FUNDS ON PROSPECTS.</title>
<headline>CYPRUS STOCK EXCHANGE BRIEFS GREEK FUNDS ON PROSPECTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus stock exchange president Dinos Papadopoulos briefed Greek institutional investors on the bourses's prospects and operations, the Association of Institutional Investors said on Monday. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
